{"version":1,"content":"<p>劍橋詞典（Cambridge Dictionary）正式公佈2026年度詞彙，最終入選的是一個看似普通、卻具有特殊時代意義的單詞——「Human」（人類）。劍橋大學於11月17日發佈公告稱，2026年圍繞人工智能與人類關係的全球討論，促使人們重新思考什麼才是真正的人類，以及人類與機器之間究竟存在怎樣的區別。隨着AI逐漸具備寫作、繪畫、音樂創作、編程乃至複雜決策能力，「Human」一詞也被賦予了新的時代意義。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586994.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:24:33.545408+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:08:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_hash":"dbc3d1fec8d1d92f564d97f1180aba561c84982a6f66aff03265407776f8a2fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}